{"id":"547c3c10df7b6c77","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-sigma-ideal.md","title":"σ-Ideal","display":"df-sigma-ideal — σ-Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sigma-ideal","aliases":["58-df-sigma-ideal"],"display":"df-sigma-ideal — σ-Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-union]]","[[58-df-subset]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sigma-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sigma-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-ideal — σ-Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"58-df-union\">58-df-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"58-df-subset\">58-df-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\;(B\\in\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\mathcal I)\\to\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}f(n)\\in\\mathcal I\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\;(B\\in\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\mathcal I)\\to\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}f(n)\\in\\mathcal I\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>(1) 空集属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>(2) 向下封闭：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal I\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal I\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq A\">\\(B\\subseteq A\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal I\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>(3) 可数并封闭：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>-成员之并仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>Related predicate: <code>58-df-baire-property</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend